{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Microjam </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">is a cute, casual collection of microgames that features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4009430/extras/e696f5231603c92a2dea7ae8c9a1c222.avif?t=1758256642\" alt=\"Micro Games\" width=1560 height=116 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">50 microgames spread across 5 packs of 10 games each!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Simple inputs, mouse only.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4009430/extras/2b366829fa2adcb10493fc6318c6c147.avif?t=1758256642\" alt=\"Game Modes\" width=1560 height=116 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Micropacks</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Bundles of 10 microgames where you get to lay back and test the waters. No lives, no pressure! Not dying rewards you with 5 stars on the micropack you were playing, which may unlock new stuff!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Infinite Mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">In infinite mode, all of the games you unlocked get combined into a single fast paced experience. The better you play, the faster and more difficult the games get</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Practice Mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Play singular microgames as many times as you need to figure them out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4009430/extras/0670a94cf1b1d3098ef505a6b3c97f1d.avif?t=1758256642\" alt=\"Collectables\" width=1560 height=116 /></span>In endless mode, beating microgames at max level will spawn a sticker machine, where you can unlock shiny stickers for your beautiful collection!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4009430/extras/12e20979a25a8940b86e21c07d2dba0d.avif?t=1758256642\" alt=\"Casual Progression\" width=1560 height=116 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Micropacks can be unlocked through achieving certain goals ingame, such as beating many microgames  in infinite mode, or getting 5 stars on a micropack!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Every game from the Micropacks you unlocked will appear in infinite mode</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4009430?t=1758256642","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4009430/9382c5caa61ba4cf736e8c8f81dfefbc027a0d86/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758256642","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4009430/23a9de0db48bbad73da085ad466f821ca922ce3a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758256642","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4009430/23a9de0db48bbad73da085ad466f821ca922ce3a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758256642","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Microjam </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">is a cute, casual collection of microgames that features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4009430/extras/e696f5231603c92a2dea7ae8c9a1c222.avif?t=1758256642\" alt=\"Micro Games\" width=1560 height=116 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">50 microgames spread across 5 packs of 10 games each!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Simple inputs, mouse only.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4009430/extras/2b366829fa2adcb10493fc6318c6c147.avif?t=1758256642\" alt=\"Game Modes\" width=1560 height=116 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Micropacks</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Bundles of 10 microgames where you get to lay back and test the waters. No lives, no pressure! Not dying rewards you with 5 stars on the micropack you were playing, which may unlock new stuff!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Infinite Mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">In infinite mode, all of the games you unlocked get combined into a single fast paced experience. The better you play, the faster and more difficult the games get</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Practice Mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Play singular microgames as many times as you need to figure them out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4009430/extras/0670a94cf1b1d3098ef505a6b3c97f1d.avif?t=1758256642\" alt=\"Collectables\" width=1560 height=116 /></span>In endless mode, beating microgames at max level will spawn a sticker machine, where you can unlock shiny stickers for your beautiful collection!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4009430/extras/12e20979a25a8940b86e21c07d2dba0d.avif?t=1758256642\" alt=\"Casual Progression\" width=1560 height=116 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Micropacks can be unlocked through achieving certain goals ingame, such as beating many microgames  in infinite mode, or getting 5 stars on a micropack!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Every game from the Micropacks you unlocked will appear in infinite mode</p>","developers":["FungalVoiid"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4009430/153279cc560180420919d8b35a43f9beee41a4e1/header.jpg?t=1758256642","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257200642,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257200642/movie480.mp4?t=1758159897","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257200642/movie_max.mp4?t=1758159897"},"name":"Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257200642/99cbb46e702b6062d24476f932cb4cf3bdd38f3f/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1758159897","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257200642/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1758159897","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_tra